Z||000000||Monkeyman||05-29-2000||12:57 PM||||Everyone's always looking for another way to mount an extra switch for driving lights, etc.  Here's what I've come up with.  Wadda ya think??  It's the fog light switch out of my sisters '90 Pontiac 6000000 SE.  (Obviously won't work if you have rear window defroster option.)<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newswitch.JPG"> ||||reg||10
